00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:15.480
you're working late at an office late at night when you suddenly get a visitor of unknown origins(oooooo spooky)

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:20.440
whose only mission is to murder you dead through strangulation of the butt.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.620
That's all I know about the game because I literally know nothing else about the game,

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.260
except it kinda takes place in an office...

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:26.180
Now the reason I-

